//imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/02/18/b8dd4b3f6585aec24cb14688d62dc0a0/static.gif?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":24,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"932710932","floor":null,"text":"看到楼主说乐队里的主唱抢走了她的现男友，我莫名其妙地想起了 Call Me Maybe这首歌还挺好听的 分享给大家[cube_喜欢]","createAt":"2026-08-15T14:51:54.000Z","up":6,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"81873787","username":"加油青年派","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2025/10/16/56b4b99a64e656335433e67bcbb744c4.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]}]},{"linkid":"176427845","title":"关于考研心得（捷径篇）","summary":"作者分享了基础薄弱的情况下，从大学混日子到决定考研的逆袭备考心得与捷径。","category":"生活日常","shareUrl":"https://api.xiaoheihe.cn/v3/bbs/app/api/web/share?h_camp=link&h_src=YXBwX3NoYXJl&link_id=dd297199c622","cover":"./media/post_176427845_0.jpeg","authorName":"七荨v","authorAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","sourceCreateAt":"2026-03-02T08:30:15.000Z","createdAt":"2026-09-08T20:38:48.000Z","tags":[{"name":"学习心得","color":"#d946ef"},{"name":"逆袭","color":"#14b8a6"},{"name":"备考","color":"#8b5cf6"},{"name":"经验分享","color":"#f59e0b"},{"name":"考研","color":"#f97316"}],"commentCount":336,"content":"首先说一下lz的个人情况，大学纯在混，偶尔学一下，靠期末周冲刺，就读于以前所说的二本，在大三下发现投简历无望 没人要，产生对找工作焦虑的情况下开始了我的考研之路，lz高中英语平均60分，数学高考60几分，大学四级次次裸考，也是次次不过，大学高数是60分飘过","images":["./media/post_176427845_0.jpeg","./media/post_176427845_1.jpeg"],"comments":[{"commentid":"815088868","floor":null,"text":"太牛批了哥 我才 330 工科[cube_乖]","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:42:05.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"34942547","username":"壹加壹大于一","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/heybox/avatar/wx/2022/02/26/044cbce2db3ccc5d21e83d19cb1e9676.jpg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815089881","floor":null,"text":"我也分享一点，学习别自己骗自己，早上背个包，去图书馆，晚上回来，学没学自己心里有点数。看一天讲课视频脑子都不动的，觉得自己可努力了。","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:43:34.000Z","up":379,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"1947884","username":"WolfIsMyName","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2025/01/14/73d8bc8306ca243ddac6bce0a88401a9.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":26,"replyUsername":null,"children":[{"commentid":"816177694","floor":null,"text":"我就那种看视频看不进去的，看了一上午左耳进右耳出，只有做题才能沉浸下去做，感觉有一定基础就不用把课都过一遍了，做题做到不会的知识点再去b站搜","createAt":"2026-03-04T03:07:15.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"59075179","username":"修0127","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/app/heybox/icon_83.5@3x.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/!100p/format/jpg","userLevel":12,"replyUsername":"WolfIsMyName","children":[]},{"commentid":"819033593","floor":null,"text":"我也是看课看不进去[cube_捂脸哭][cube_捂脸哭]尝试自己刷题发现漏了很多技巧性东西[cube_哭泣][cube_哭泣]，尤其是一些概念性的题目几乎无从下手","createAt":"2026-03-08T17:47:59.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43018222","username":"剑影愕","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/04/18/8b56c28b977fe7387e89f2056122ec51.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":"修0127","children":[]},{"commentid":"823030376","floor":null,"text":"真是，1000题有的都想不到，有的题感觉有针对的技巧","createAt":"2026-03-14T20:10:31.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"59075179","username":"修0127","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/app/heybox/icon_83.5@3x.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/!100p/format/jpg","userLevel":12,"replyUsername":"剑影愕","children":[]},{"commentid":"823119021","floor":null,"text":"1000题总感觉做起来怪怪的， 我就没做了。[cube_叹气]","createAt":"2026-03-15T02:33:54.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43018222","username":"剑影愕","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/04/18/8b56c28b977fe7387e89f2056122ec51.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":"修0127","children":[]},{"commentid":"833513617","floor":null,"text":"那我这种专业课全是背的，一天到晚抱着书背背背的怎么办[cube_委屈]","createAt":"2026-03-29T14:10:30.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"58476453","username":"Ariala","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/05/24/b63d9e46051341907bae68e1fb1b5554.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"WolfIsMyName","children":[]},{"commentid":"846566689","floor":null,"text":"磕时间就好了","createAt":"2026-04-16T23:46:05.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"59799509","username":"2u35","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/heybox/avatar/wx/2023/11/20/ca7041afdb3ec60496c12e91d0c0d93e.jpg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":12,"replyUsername":"Ariala","children":[]},{"commentid":"850638962","floor":null,"text":"我靠，感觉这就是我[cube_摘墨镜]","createAt":"2026-04-22T16:25:44.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"57853342","username":"YaHooZen","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/app/heybox/icon_83.5@3x.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/!100p/format/jpg","userLevel":12,"replyUsername":"WolfIsMyName","children":[]},{"commentid":"872802376","floor":null,"text":"不知道自己骗自己怎么办[cube_僵尸]我一上午就只能背点单词，写五篇阅读理解，两篇翻译，但是写完后会复盘好一会，然后整会数学到十二点。中午休息到1点半，下午听武老的高数基础听到四点，四点到六点写题，六点到七点休息，然后一直写题到九点回寝室，十点准时睡觉。六点半起的床，洗漱吃饭到七点半，将近八点开始学。然后我每隔一个半小时到两小时要去厕所抽一根。我这个安排没问题吧[cube_欧润吉]","createAt":"2026-05-24T05:06:04.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"54667745","username":"杰洛特的李维亚","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/05/04/606e300e6c8249e169f9f12c65eb8f71.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":"WolfIsMyName","children":[]}]},{"commentid":"815090552","floor":null,"text":"考研经验","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:44:33.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"66756357","username":"H2OWL","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/06/29/ee7ca9a6ab33a52dfe042c770a2451ad.webp?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815090792","floor":null,"text":"复试真的会歧视本科学历吗？或者说复试真的有很多关系户吗？","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:44:56.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"70276287","username":"狗子AQA","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/05/22/f6d849c02ffdfd3ca17adf4eafbbc492.webp?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815090827","floor":null,"text":"大佬三月份每天学多久，也是八九个小时吗[cube_摘墨镜]","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:44:59.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"60450094","username":"青麟明白","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/07/01/19b3c862132f3cd6460af69e9a8a4df0/static/static.gif?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":null,"children":[{"commentid":"815104578","floor":null,"text":"跟我考同一个学校的同学，每天10小时高强度，但是也是5月开的，最终数二130几，英语90，这还是太强了","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:05:10.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"青麟明白","children":[]}]},{"commentid":"815091712","floor":null,"text":"万战老兵前来报道","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:46:19.000Z","up":1,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"45939718","username":"dr00wang","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/02/12/128ebb60712a521efcafeedac47f7615.webp?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":15,"replyUsername":null,"children":[{"commentid":"815780718","floor":null,"text":"去年的吧","createAt":"2026-03-03T09:44:21.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"45067084","username":"跟你说个四十","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2022/11/04/e5d1b31e047bd2c73e339c5d44d953cc.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":"哈哈哈54888","children":[]},{"commentid":"817788504","floor":null,"text":"我这个是非全日制研究生 24年底考的 不过分也能上全日制了 舍不得外企工作","createAt":"2026-03-06T12:26:12.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"45939718","username":"dr00wang","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/02/12/128ebb60712a521efcafeedac47f7615.webp?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":15,"replyUsername":"哈哈哈54888","children":[]},{"commentid":"817789088","floor":null,"text":"我考了两年本校全日制 后来才考的tj","createAt":"2026-03-06T12:27:30.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"45939718","username":"dr00wang","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/02/12/128ebb60712a521efcafeedac47f7615.webp?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":15,"replyUsername":"七荨v","children":[]}]},{"commentid":"815091729","floor":null,"text":"这个专业课太高了[cube_委屈]","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:46:21.000Z","up":1,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"59558522","username":"creeper666","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/05/02/805390ef8d517a9fa9dfafeab2899954.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815092033","floor":null,"text":"牛的兄弟，我英二要你这个分就可以了，现在一天八十单词都得背一个多小时[cube_感动]","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:46:46.000Z","up":3,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"63690500","username":"玩家63690500","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2025/10/30/3308b33893027cbea6797fb57063319a.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815092141","floor":null,"text":"看学校，很多学校会歧视出身，关系户这一块你担心了也没用，考研如果是人生计划的一部分那直接走就行，有尽力了剩下的就别管，别让外界的事情影响你学习[cube_摘墨镜]","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:46:54.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"71106021","username":"吟雪追风","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2025/04/21/5ec995d3307f9dd93ac85d010516a030.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"狗子AQA","children":[]},{"commentid":"815092607","floor":null,"text":"楼主学硕和专硕怎么选择的，就是数一数二[cube_并不简单][cube_并不简单]","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:47:34.000Z","up":4,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"58982445","username":"欣喜若狂的刽子手","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/07/23/06cc6f70e898d31d620c2dd3d4c3000a.webp?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815092716","floor":null,"text":"我现在也很迷茫啊，我是机械电子工程的，四级没过，考研也没有计划，我就直接想出来找工作，现在也是浑浑噩噩过日子[cube_哭泣]","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:47:44.000Z","up":42,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"73874835","username":"木楼咯","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/01/14/cacc4e2be0739a6825cf792a29abf302.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":null,"children":[{"commentid":"815302050","floor":null,"text":"但是我听说我们学校对标的是下煤矿，我在想还有没有其他的就业方向[cube_摘墨镜]","createAt":"2026-03-02T15:08:22.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"73874835","username":"木楼咯","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/01/14/cacc4e2be0739a6825cf792a29abf302.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":"星环里的梦","children":[]},{"commentid":"815498907","floor":null,"text":"矿大机械吗[cube_惊讶]","createAt":"2026-03-03T02:14:49.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"58730096","username":"里昂S肯尼尼","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/04/04/093c09d701f258454b0dcbb9aacdf3f1.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":14,"replyUsername":"木楼咯","children":[]},{"commentid":"815837964","floor":null,"text":"不算矿大吧，但是听说我们学校对接的企业是下煤矿的[cube_笑cry]","createAt":"2026-03-03T11:22:24.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"73874835","username":"木楼咯","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/01/14/cacc4e2be0739a6825cf792a29abf302.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":"里昂S肯尼尼","children":[]},{"commentid":"818173735","floor":null,"text":"我也机械电子工程的  建议你先把四六级过了吧","createAt":"2026-03-07T06:33:01.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"63200003","username":"公鸡开大巴22","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2025/04/22/69dbe964b0bdc734c1b105cada98d033.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"木楼咯","children":[]},{"commentid":"818314514","floor":null,"text":"[cube_打脸]。","createAt":"2026-03-07T11:16:11.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"55095479","username":"二狗子73","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_6.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":"木楼咯","children":[]},{"commentid":"819655481","floor":null,"text":"焦虑的解决办法","createAt":"2026-03-09T16:49:58.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"75213299","username":"拾遗十一","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/08/11/96e8ec27a782851d73626ae2afb281fa.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":15,"replyUsername":"七荨v","children":[]},{"commentid":"840747759","floor":null,"text":"不会是太理吧[cube_滑稽]","createAt":"2026-04-08T23:20:27.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"81483917","username":"玩家81483917","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/app/heybox/icon_83.5@3x.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/!100p/format/jpg","userLevel":7,"replyUsername":"木楼咯","children":[]},{"commentid":"862867306","floor":null,"text":"兄弟，我也机电的，24届毕业的，现在在北京某国企干测试，一个月到手七千多，听我一句劝，最好还是考个研，不然本科出来真的处处受限。研究生出来，才够资格去研发，研发至少可以少下车间。有个自己的工位[cube_感动][cube_感动][cube_感动]","createAt":"2026-05-10T14:48:06.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"32045137","username":"爱打游戏怎么了","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/09/18/8eca04c6f467f93d3eb4e9ca6e9ac137.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":"木楼咯","children":[]}]},{"commentid":"815098508","floor":null,"text":"对的，这种在别人看来还觉得很努力，但是只有自己才明白","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:56:06.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"WolfIsMyName","children":[]},{"commentid":"815099204","floor":null,"text":"学硕一般是数一，专硕一般是数二，专硕比学硕卷一点，然后学硕是数一，肯定比数二难，数一学得东西要多一些","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:57:11.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"欣喜若狂的刽子手","children":[]},{"commentid":"815100905","floor":null,"text":"我大三下也是每天焦虑睡不着，但是等你真的暑假出去找工作，或者秋招，其实也没有那么难，秋招机会还是挺多，然后自己去大城市找也可以，周围同学都是去的一线城市，等你这段时间过去了之后，你才会发现以前好像没必要那么焦虑，不要焦虑太未知的事情，这样只会徒增烦恼，还有就是想到的东西就去做，不要一直就想，比如你想找工作，就开始投简历，开始联系，要考研就开始准备，想玩几天就安心玩几天","createAt":"2026-03-02T08:59:47.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"木楼咯","children":[]},{"commentid":"815101480","floor":null,"text":"我100个单词第二天也是只能记住几个，我每天就是点点点，只需要记住意思，不需要会写，我前期每天甚至要记2个小时，3个小时","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:00:43.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"玩家63690500","children":[]},{"commentid":"815101962","floor":null,"text":"同济大学还是太强了，兄弟，我做梦都不敢想这些学校[cube_捂脸哭][cube_捂脸哭][cube_捂脸哭]","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:01:28.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"dr00wang","children":[]},{"commentid":"815102515","floor":null,"text":"我身边有3月开学的，数一，每天也是学8，9小时，然后最终数一也是考了110，但是这真的很难坚持，加油","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:02:17.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"青麟明白","children":[]},{"commentid":"815102986","floor":null,"text":"尽人事，听天命啦，不过报院校的时候可以多了解一下这个院校是怎么样的","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:02:58.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"狗子AQA","children":[]},{"commentid":"815103162","floor":null,"text":"纯专业课简单，考得不是好学校啦","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:03:13.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"壹加壹大于一","children":[]},{"commentid":"815103986","floor":null,"text":"收到，加油！","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:04:20.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"60450094","username":"青麟明白","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/07/01/19b3c862132f3cd6460af69e9a8a4df0/static/static.gif?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":"七荨v","children":[]},{"commentid":"815106648","floor":null,"text":"有课怎么办","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:08:08.000Z","up":3,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"58478722","username":"水滴飘零","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/05/28/ef3e786730cc9645cf409cd2bb6dc415.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":null,"children":[{"commentid":"815125760","floor":null,"text":"对的，我们自习室和教学楼很近，上完课就去自习室了","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:36:50.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"水滴飘零","children":[]}]},{"commentid":"815110786","floor":null,"text":"我当时也是有课，大三下还有实训，那就可以记单词，等我正式开始考研的时候，5月份开始也是快期末，就没有太多课程，然后期末我是直接停摆了半个月专心准备期末，中途是有时间就是高强度看高数，一天要看10小时高数，花十几天就看完了，然后单词每天还是记，这个不影响，老师上课我看单词","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:14:01.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"水滴飘零","children":[]},{"commentid":"815115891","floor":null,"text":"就是8点多去晚上回是包含了上课吗，不是一直在自习是吗[cube_害羞]","createAt":"2026-03-02T09:21:47.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"58478722","username":"水滴飘零","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/05/28/ef3e786730cc9645cf409cd2bb6dc415.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":"七荨v","children":[]},{"commentid":"815133116","floor":null,"text":null,"createAt":"2026-03-02T09:48:55.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"58668012","username":"旧林林","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/07/09/b4652319f357fb8daae51a33d124944c.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815144863","floor":null,"text":"[cube_哭泣]我今年要毕业了，英语太差了（高考 30 多）所以没报考研，出来找工作发现专业太拉了（环境）找不到啥工作，哎现在准备狠下心来好好背单词先把四级过了，看看后续能不能跨专业考个研了[cube_哭泣]在新疆懒散惯了真卷不动[cube_哭泣]","createAt":"2026-03-02T10:07:26.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"25779684","username":"小克忠实粉丝","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/avatar/wx/1620745223/4104677f69c33f6ebf40947ab8f04627?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815164709","floor":null,"text":"考研经验","createAt":"2026-03-02T10:39:57.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"72301208","username":"昱圭","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/05/21/985328777fe8cde6618def3c4d291dbc.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815182424","floor":null,"text":"考研经验","createAt":"2026-03-02T11:10:03.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"78686714","username":"东多西少","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/heybox/avatar/wx/2025/01/30/6bb3c5efd96e1d59c0f117f65089afa0.jpg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815197745","floor":null,"text":"NB","createAt":"2026-03-02T11:37:08.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"55208847","username":"斩色","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/heybox/avatar/wx/2023/06/22/226700e9c148de5113a62e69743d4058.jpg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815212276","floor":null,"text":"我这个方法应该是做题很少，外加没有什么数学天赋的办法，只做了30讲例题，1000题的基础题，然后近15年真题（做了8遍），这个方法不仅是我个人奏效，我周围跟我一起考研的朋友也是这个方法，他们没有我做的次数多，最低的也是90分，高的往130走了（但是这个是在做真题之上还强化了，就是做了强化题，以及各种模拟卷子，和其他题）","createAt":"2026-03-02T12:04:20.000Z","up":100,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":null,"children":[{"commentid":"815618978","floor":null,"text":"我说实话这个仅限今年，因为今年的数二真的太简单了，完全就是大学期末水平。我前面写模拟卷就120平均分，结果今年考了个147","createAt":"2026-03-03T05:26:47.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"49548441","username":"sinA","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/08/14/45d9d58c76f182d55e676a77d04c107b.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":"七荨v","children":[]},{"commentid":"815620113","floor":null,"text":"英语我四级432飘过，六级也是这个学期才过的。可以说我英语完全没有天赋吧。但今年英二也同样巨无比简单，换以前我考81是想都不敢想","createAt":"2026-03-03T05:28:54.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"49548441","username":"sinA","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/08/14/45d9d58c76f182d55e676a77d04c107b.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":"七荨v","children":[]},{"commentid":"815684355","floor":null,"text":"对的，主要是不难","createAt":"2026-03-03T07:18:54.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"sinA","children":[]},{"commentid":"815685918","floor":null,"text":"啊，我双非期末不是这个水平啊，我给这个参考也仅限双非的，像211，985的学生肯定有更好更高效的学习方法，我这个方法考80，90还是可以，但是想考100，120还是不行的，始终要多做，多看，自己去理解","createAt":"2026-03-03T07:21:09.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"sinA","children":[]},{"commentid":"815995635","floor":null,"text":"考研教程➕保姆[cube_滑稽]","createAt":"2026-03-03T16:42:47.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"72107829","username":"枳个柚","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2025/10/11/10ad648c9ca4a03fa2e648dba9f553a3.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":10,"replyUsername":"七荨v","children":[]},{"commentid":"816375278","floor":null,"text":"我和你很像，做题很少，但是把例题都吃透了[cube_沧桑]","createAt":"2026-03-04T08:31:44.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"94924618","username":"玩家94924618","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/app/heybox/icon_83.5@3x.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/!100p/format/jpg","userLevel":null,"replyUsername":"七荨v","children":[]},{"commentid":"816548429","floor":null,"text":"例题我感觉我也没有完全吃透[cube_捂脸哭][cube_捂脸哭][cube_捂脸哭]","createAt":"2026-03-04T13:58:53.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"玩家94924618","children":[]},{"commentid":"827170338","floor":null,"text":"讲一下择校哥","createAt":"2026-03-20T17:33:12.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"18270502","username":"ky6672","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_15.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":"七荨v","children":[]}]},{"commentid":"815229721","floor":null,"text":"楼主第二张是四级吗？是直接学考研英语二后顺便考了个四级吗？","createAt":"2026-03-02T12:39:12.000Z","up":2,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"63107513","username":"单辰宇","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_12.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":13,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815234667","floor":null,"text":"哥，想问一下你是怎么挑学校的，有什么好点的筛选方式吗[cube_打脸]","createAt":"2026-03-02T12:49:16.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"73908063","username":"佩鲛","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/12/12/a175095151c6763295c11031f2e27325.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":null,"children":[{"commentid":"815249941","floor":null,"text":"推荐一个粉笔考研APP，免费的，看学校挺方便，但还是要自己记录下来一一对比","createAt":"2026-03-02T13:20:39.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"48593552","username":"Gyve-ka","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/03/24/25a61d8fb3d5f7a22d9b6966fb6d03d0.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":"佩鲛","children":[]},{"commentid":"815340267","floor":null,"text":"首先看你想读那个地方，先看地方再看学校，然后清楚自己的实力，不要一来就是心高气傲，结果自己不努力去学，或者就是报巨卷的学校专业，也不要低估了自己的实力，不然可以考一些211或者985，又去了一个普通双非，这样就会后悔，我现在就有点难受[cube_摘墨镜][cube_摘墨镜][cube_摘墨镜]","createAt":"2026-03-02T16:21:36.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"佩鲛","children":[]}]},{"commentid":"815235040","floor":null,"text":"我也是开始了，但是对于选学校还是有点懵，不太清楚是个什么流程[cube_哭泣]","createAt":"2026-03-02T12:50:00.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"73908063","username":"佩鲛","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/12/12/a175095151c6763295c11031f2e27325.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"佩鲛","children":[]},{"commentid":"815238109","floor":null,"text":"有没有老哥说一下张宇的零基础用听吗，有用吗[cube_惊讶]还是说直接开始基础三十讲第一讲呢","createAt":"2026-03-02T12:56:10.000Z","up":1,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"58095463","username":"我爱白嫖亿下","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/07/28/97ff961f516c6e1a6cd1cd8d84b9fea7.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":null,"children":[{"commentid":"815339443","floor":null,"text":"不听，没用","createAt":"2026-03-02T16:19:56.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"43642136","username":"七荨v","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/profile/avatar/heygirl_7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":16,"replyUsername":"我爱白嫖亿下","children":[]}]},{"commentid":"815245508","floor":null,"text":"我比你多一分[cube_滑稽]","createAt":"2026-03-02T13:11:25.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"22339271","username":"幼羽","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/07/19/cbb36c1b5fa3e359004a334b01e1f6d9.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815247226","floor":null,"text":"其实听不听还得看自己，抽空听一下呗","createAt":"2026-03-02T13:14:58.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"48593552","username":"Gyve-ka","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/03/24/25a61d8fb3d5f7a22d9b6966fb6d03d0.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":"我爱白嫖亿下","children":[]},{"commentid":"815249428","floor":null,"text":"我先定专业，土木跨电气，然后选的湖北省和东北那边以及二区的学校，再看录取人数，我选的都差不多招100人以上，然后看专业课，最近正好考研出分就等各个学校今年的分数情况，然后进行比对，重要的一点是，择校是一个动态的过程，真定下来起码得等暑假，现在就要看自己数学和英语的复习情况","createAt":"2026-03-02T13:19:33.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"48593552","username":"Gyve-ka","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/03/24/25a61d8fb3d5f7a22d9b6966fb6d03d0.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":"佩鲛","children":[]},{"commentid":"815251610","floor":null,"text":"机械考研性价比很高的，最好读研，本科出来工资撑死六七千，研究生起码能去研发，不用整天待在车间","createAt":"2026-03-02T13:24:02.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"89053863","username":"星环里的梦","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2026/07/18/0acd3779c415af2937e489a90dec40d6.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":11,"replyUsername":"木楼咯","children":[]},{"commentid":"815268756","floor":null,"text":"考研","createAt":"2026-03-02T13:59:32.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"62122814","username":"想约你散步","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2025/09/22/eafcd1f7aa38e4492684a13b5cbabb2d.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":15,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815274395","floor":null,"text":"同济英二数二这个分就能上？","createAt":"2026-03-02T14:11:45.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"58571720","username":"哈哈哈54888","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2024/12/25/ee849c90e11b389c6ad37d431a66d71c.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":17,"replyUsername":"dr00wang","children":[]},{"commentid":"815288716","floor":null,"text":"专业课炸了[cube_摘墨镜]下岸了[cube_摘墨镜][cube_摘墨镜]","createAt":"2026-03-02T14:41:19.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"14656754","username":"苷央o","userAvatar":"https://cdn.max-c.com/heybox/avatar/d98e1be90656dcbf65c88b3aa3dcc480?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":28,"replyUsername":null,"children":[]},{"commentid":"815305995","floor":null,"text":"没用，别听","createAt":"2026-03-02T15:15:54.000Z","up":0,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"56956017","username":"DDDDoraemon","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/heybox/avatar/wx/2023/08/21/1fecd60c350f284e0f58be3ed4719ce2.jpg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":19,"replyUsername":"我爱白嫖亿下","children":[]},{"commentid":"815306419","floor":null,"text":"大佬，现在大三英语四级400没过，准备考研，现在准备用不背单词背，我添加的考研7000词汇的书，它是不是包含了所有的四级词汇呢，然后就是一天大概背多少单词合适呢，我看不背单词每天的背诵个数最多只能20[cube_窝囊][cube_窝囊]","createAt":"2026-03-02T15:16:43.000Z","up":1,"isAuthor":false,"imageUrls":[],"userid":"58088522","username":"sffdbssntsdn","userAvatar":"https://imgheybox.max-c.com/avatar/2025/09/21/ee681dcd3c77c7b0ccb8a9bdb94805c2.jpeg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/100x100%3E","userLevel":18,"replyUsername":null,"children":[{"commentid":"815456198","floor":null,"text":"好的感谢","createAt":"2026-03-03T01:03:50.000Z","up":0,"isA